      "off_details": "<p><strong>Soaring Strike: </strong>Deals extra <strong>5</strong> damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Skyjump:&nbsp;</strong>Deals extra <strong>10</strong> damage and gains <strong>Multi(2)</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Heart in the Engine:&nbsp;</strong>Deals extra <strong>6</strong> damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Advanced Targeting:&nbsp;</strong>Increases accuracy by <strong>2</strong>.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
