      "passive_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<p>Permanently increase your maximum Hit Points <strong>and </strong>maximum Mind Points by 5.<br>Choose one option: gain the ability to equip <strong>martial melee and ranged weapons</strong>,<br><strong>martial armor</strong>, and <strong>martial shields</strong>; <strong>or</strong> learn any one spell from the <strong>Elementalist</strong> or<br><strong>Spiritist</strong> lists; <strong>or</strong> permanently increase your maximum Inventory Points by 2.</p>",
          "passive_name": "Survivor",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "quirk"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<p>You unlock the hidden art of aerial spear combat, learning the <strong>Skyjump </strong>spell.</p>",
          "passive_name": "Skyspear Style",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "heroic_style"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<p>After you cast the <strong>first </strong>spell of your turn during a conflict, if you are driving your<strong> personal vehicle</strong>, you may choose one option (after the spell has been resolved): choose one enabled module and <strong>disable </strong>it, then choose one disabled module and <strong>enable </strong>it; <strong>or</strong> the next spell you cast before the end of this scene that deals damage deals 5 extra damage; <strong>or</strong> the next spell you cast before the end of this scene that restores Hit Points to one or more creatures restores 10 additional Hit Points to each of those creatures.</p>",
          "passive_name": "Steel Witch",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "heroic_style"
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<p>Once before the next rest, when you perform an attack, you may grant that attack <strong>multi (2)</strong> or increase its <strong>multi </strong>property by one point.</p>",
          "passive_name": "Martial Practice",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "camp activity"
        },
        "4": {
